      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "Pulsed dye laser therapy has revolutionized the treatment of benign vascular neoplasms of the skin. Treatment is safe and generally effective in children of all ages. Because of the pain associated with the treatment, special techniques are discussed that may minimize the physical and psychological traumas associated with treatment."},
